<section class="lp-card"><h2>Spreadsheet → Lightek system</h2><p>Upload XLSX, CSV, TSV or TXT. Lightek reads the structure into private native sheets, preserves cell references and recalculates its supported formula subset. Macros, embedded objects, external links and unknown formulas require review rather than execution.</p><% if @can_write %><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_workbooks_path(employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),multipart: true,class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><label>Workbook · up to 5 MB<%= f.file_field :file,required: true,accept: '.xlsx,.csv,.tsv,.txt' %></label><%= f.submit 'Convert workbook structure',class: 'lp-button' %><% end %><% end %></section><nav class="lp-runs" aria-label="Imported spreadsheet systems"><% @workbooks.each do |record| %><%= link_to record.name,accounting_path(tab: 'workbooks',workbook_id: record.id) %><% end %></nav><% if @workbook %><% schema=@workbook.data;engine=LightekAccounting::SheetFormula.new(schema) %><section class="lp-card"><h2><%= @workbook.name %></h2><p>Native calculations: SUM, MIN, MAX, COUNT, AVERAGE, IF, IFERROR, ROUND, ABS, SUMIF and COUNTIF, plus supported arithmetic and local references. Unsupported cells show a review finding; cached Excel formula results are not trusted.</p><% schema['sheets'].each do |sheet| %><details><summary><%= sheet['name'] %> · <%= sheet['cells'].size %> cells</summary><div class="lp-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Source cell</th><th>Native value</th><th>Rule / type</th></tr></thead><tbody><% sheet['cells'].first(200).each do |address,cell| %><tr><td><%= address %></td><td><%= accounting_cell_value(engine,sheet['name'],address) %></td><td><%= cell['formula'].presence || cell['type'] %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div><p>Showing the first 200 populated cells in this sheet.</p></details><% end %><% if @can_write %><details><summary>Edit a native input</summary><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_workbook_cell_path(@workbook,employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><label>Worksheet<%= f.select :sheet,schema['sheets'].map { |s| s['name'] } %></label><label>Source cell<%= f.text_field :address,required: true,placeholder: 'B2' %></label><label>Value<%= f.text_field :value,required: true %></label><%= f.submit 'Save input & recalculate',class: 'lp-button secondary' %><% end %></details><details><summary>Convert a table into native records</summary><%= form_with url: convert_dashboard_accounting_workbook_path(@workbook,employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><label>Conversion target<%= f.select :target, [["Statement transactions","transactions"],["Categories: Name, Kind, Schedule C, Deductible Percent","categories"],["Rules: Keyword, Category, Priority","keyword_rules"]] %></label><label>Worksheet<%= f.select :sheet,schema['sheets'].map { |s| s['name'] } %></label><label>Header row<%= f.number_field :header_row,min: 1,value: 1,required: true %></label><label>Destination account · transactions only<%= f.select :bank_account_id,@accounts.map { |a| [a.name,a.id] },include_blank: "Choose for transaction conversion" %></label><%= f.submit 'Convert reviewed table',class: 'lp-button' %><% end %></details><% end %></section><% end %>
